WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.153 --> 00:00:04.891
Read a practice desk. The connected Frontier AI desk shows a paper value chart and its next real-price check. Practice spends no money.

2
00:00:04.891 --> 00:00:11.265
Inspect Activity. Each check has a reason and opens a full decision record. These paper records are not sealed on the ledger.

3
00:00:11.265 --> 00:00:16.519
Inspect Rules. Rule cards say which limits a live desk's own contract would enforce and which the desk runner enforces.

4
00:00:16.519 --> 00:00:20.203
Read the promise. The promise copy describes a live desk's sealed record even on this practice page. Practice itself writes nothing to the ledger; this mismatch was reported.
